1	Resistance will bring only pain and devastation. Very soon, Persian flags will be flying high all across the land.
2	Both the Athenians and the Spartans will soon be slaves of the Persians.
3	Ha-ha, I am an invader, come to plunder the riches of Greece. However, I tire of such weak challenges, most of these peasants don't even try to stop me when I take their wealth. 
4	I am Mardonius. Remember that name when you try to take my precious stuff and fall before my blade.